OneIsland_Text_BillLetsGoSeeCelio::
    .string "BILL: Here we are!\n"
    .string "This is ONE ISLAND.\p"
    .string "There are several islands around\n"
    .string "here, and this is one of them.\p"
    .string "My friend CELIO sent the boat to\n"
    .string "fetch me here.\p"
    .string "He's in charge of the island's PC\n"
    .string "network by his lonesome.\p"
    .string "…Why am I telling you this now?\n"
    .string "Let's just go see CELIO!$"

Text_WhereDoYouWantToSail::
    .string "Ahoy, there!\n"
    .string "Where do you want to sail?$"

OneIsland_Text_LuckyToHaveCelioHere::
    .string "Here we are on an island smack in\n"
    .string "the middle of nowhere.\p"
    .string "We're lucky to have an upstanding\n"
    .string "young man like CELIO here.\p"
    .string "My granddaughter was in a tizzy\n"
    .string "over CELIO's friend.\p"
    .string "Something about a famous\n"
    .string "POKéMANIAC?\p"
    .string "I'm not sure what that means, but\n"
    .string "CELIO is quite the man!$"

OneIsland_Text_HavePCLinkageWithKanto::
    .string "My granddaughter was in a tizzy\n"
    .string "over a new breakthrough.\p"
    .string "She said we now have PC linkage\n"
    .string "with people in KANTO.\p"
    .string "I'm not sure what that means, but\n"
    .string "CELIO is quite the man!$"

OneIsland_Text_HavePCLinkageWithHoenn::
    .string "My granddaughter was in a tizzy\n"
    .string "over a new breakthrough.\p"
    .string "She said we finally have PC linkage\n"
    .string "with people in HOENN.\p"
    .string "I'm not sure what that means, but\n"
    .string "CELIO is quite the man.\p"
    .string "He would make a fine husband for\n"
    .string "my granddaughter!$"

OneIsland_Text_IslandSign::
    .string "ONE ISLAND\n"
    .string "The first stop. Embers never die.$"

OneIsland_Text_PokemonNetCenterSign::
    .string "Expanding the POKéMON World!\n"
    .string "POKéMON NET CENTER$"

@ Unused
OneIsland_Text_ReturnToCinnabar::
    .string "グレンタウンに　もどりますか？$"

OneIsland_Text_IsntWarmClimateHereGreat::
    .string "Sight-seeing? Nice time for it.\p"
    .string "The sun here sets a little late\n"
    .string "these days. The clocks at the port\l"
    .string "don't agree with each other.$"


OneIsland_Text_Lord1::
    .string "WILL: I read your thoughts before you\n"
    .string "speak, CHAMPION. You hold six\llegends and fear your own power.\pLet me test that fear!$"

OneIsland_Text_Lord2::
    .string "I saw the wrong future.$"

OneIsland_Text_Lord3::
    .string "WILL: The mind is a door, not a wall.\n"
    .string "Keep yours open. Take this.$"

OneIsland_Text_LordEarly::
    .string "WILL: Not yet. The old LEAGUE\n"
    .string "and the MASTERS must fall first.\n"
    .string "FLORA will tell you the way.$"

OneIsland_Text_LordDone::
    .string "WILL: A ruler worthy of the six.\n"
    .string "I will remember this day.$"

OneIsland_Text_LordIdle::
    .string "WILL: The islands are quiet. I look\n"
    .string "after them, as I always have.$"

OneIsland_Text_RefAsk::
    .string "JONAH: Poachers took a baby from its\n"
    .string "mother on the shore. Bring them\n"
    .string "to justice, please.$"

OneIsland_Text_RefHunter1::
    .string "HUNTER: Rare ones fetch a fortune!\n"
    .string "Stay out of this, child!$"

OneIsland_Text_RefHunter2::
    .string "HUNTER: You beat my partner? Fine,\n"
    .string "I am not afraid of a ranger!$"

OneIsland_Text_RefGives::
    .string "JONAH: You saved the day. The post\n"
    .string "has a gift for you: KANGASKHAN!$"

OneIsland_Text_RefAfter::
    .string "JONAH: Take good care of it. The\n"
    .string "next REFUGE post is waiting.$"

OneIsland_Text_RefEarly::
    .string "JONAH: Not yet. Finish the earlier\n"
    .string "posts first. The KEEPER at the\n"
    .string "SAFARI ZONE knows the order.$"

OneIsland_Text_RefDone::
    .string "JONAH: Thank you again. The REFUGE\n"
    .string "is safer because of you.$"

OneIsland_Text_RefIdle::
    .string "JONAH: I watch over the animals here.\n"
    .string "The world is quieter now.$"

OneIsland_Text_BillWaiting::
    .string "BILL: There you are! CELIO and I\n"
    .string "are waiting at the POKéMON CENTER.\p"
    .string "The Echoes are all over the\n"
    .string "islands. Come, we will explain!$"
